  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women Entrepreneurship Jordan (BIP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support Jordanian women to start their own companies and/or projects. The project will strengthen ongoing social reforms in Jordan and contribute to more women starting businesses and creating new workplaces. The project is modelled on the work methods of BIP&#x2019;s work on women&#x2019;s entrepreneurship in Iraq.</narrative>
  </description>
